// Local, developer-specific build settings.
//
// Do not edit this template. `scripts/generate-ios-project.sh` copies it to
// Local.xcconfig, which is gitignored, so your Team ID never reaches the
// repository — this one is public.
//
// Your Apple Developer Team ID. Required only for builds onto a physical
// device; simulator builds sign to run locally and need nothing here.
//
// Find it with:
//     security find-certificate -c "Apple Development" -p \
//       | openssl x509 -noout -subject
// and take the OU field. The generate script fills this in automatically when
// it finds exactly one signing certificate in your keychain.
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
